<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Smit IPO Ready Checker</title>
<meta name="description" content="SEBI ICDR & SME Exchange IPO eligibility, restated financials, proforma applicability and Basis of Issue Price calculator.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0B2545">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="IPO Ready">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Slab:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F5F7FA; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface-2:#EEF2F6; --border:#D9E2EA;
  --text:#132538; --text-dim:#5A6B7D; --primary:#0B2545; --primary-2:#123A6B;
  --accent:#B8860B; --accent-2:#D9A62A; --success:#1F7A4D; --success-bg:#E7F5EC;
  --danger:#B3261E; --danger-bg:#FBEAE9; --warn:#8A5A00; --warn-bg:#FBF1DC;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(11,37,69,.06),0 4px 14px rgba(11,37,69,.06);
  --radius:10px; --mono:'Roboto Mono',monospace;
}
[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#0B121F; --surface:#121B2C; --surface-2:#182338; --border:#28374F;
  --text:#E7EDF5; --text-dim:#93A3B8; --primary:#7FA8DE; --primary-2:#A9C6EE;
  --accent:#E0B84C; --accent-2:#F0CE73; --success:#3FBE7F; --success-bg:#123023;
  --danger:#F0645C; --danger-bg:#331616; --warn:#E0B84C; --warn-bg:#332A10;
  --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3),0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
body{
  font-family:'Roboto',system-ui,sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
  transition:background .25s ease, color .25s ease; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  padding-bottom:60px;
}
h1,h2,h3,.display{font-family:'Roboto Slab',serif;}
a{color:var(--primary-2);}
::selection{background:var(--accent); color:#111;}

/* ---------- Top bar ---------- */
.topbar{
  position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background:var(--primary); color:#fff;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px;
  padding:14px 20px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
[data-theme="dark"] .topbar{background:#0D1729;}
.brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; min-width:0;}
.brand-seal{
  width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:9px; flex:0 0 auto;
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--accent-2),var(--accent));
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Roboto Slab';
  font-weight:800; color:#1a1200; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:.5px;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.35);
}
.brand-text{min-width:0;}
.brand-text h1{margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:1.15; letter-spacing:.2px;}
.brand-text .subtitle{
  margin:2px 0 0; font-size:11.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.78); letter-spacing:.3px;
  display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.brand-text .subtitle a{color:#fff; text-decoration:underline; text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);}
.top-actions{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex:0 0 auto;}
.icon-btn{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); color:#fff;
  border-radius:8px; padding:9px 12px; cursor:pointer; font-size:13px; font-family:inherit;
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; transition:background .15s;
}
.icon-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);}
#installBtn{display:none;}

/* ---------- Layout ---------- */
.shell{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:18px 16px 40px;}
.tabs{
  display:flex; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; padding:4px; background:var(--surface);
  border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  scrollbar-width:thin;
}
.tab-btn{
  flex:1 1 auto; white-space:nowrap; border:none; background:transparent; color:var(--text-dim);
  font-family:inherit; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:9px;
  cursor:pointer; transition:.15s; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
}
.tab-btn .num{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11px; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:var(--surface-2); flex:0 0 auto;
}
.tab-btn.active{background:var(--primary); color:#fff;}
.tab-btn.active .num{background:var(--accent); color:#1a1200;}
.tab-btn:not(.active):hover{background:var(--surface-2); color:var(--text);}

.panel{display:none; animation:fade .25s ease;}
.panel.active{display:block;}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(4px);} to{opacity:1; transform:none;}}

.card{
  background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:20px; margin-bottom:16px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.card h2{margin:0 0 4px; font-size:19px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
.card h2 .tag{
  font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--primary-2); background:var(--surface-2);
  border:1px solid var(--border); padding:3px 8px; border-radius:20px; font-weight:500;
}
.card .lead{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px; margin:6px 0 16px; line-height:1.55;}
.section-divider{margin:26px 0 14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px; font-weight:600;}
.section-divider::after{content:""; flex:1; height:1px; background:var(--border);}

/* checklist */
.rule{
  border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:9px; padding:12px 14px; margin-bottom:10px;
  background:var(--surface-2);
}
.rule-head{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start;}
.rule-head input[type=checkbox]{width:19px; height:19px; margin-top:2px; accent-color:var(--primary); flex:0 0 auto; cursor:pointer;}
.rule-head label{font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.55; cursor:pointer;}
.rule-cite{display:block; margin-top:3px; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--accent);}
.rule.select-row .rule-head{align-items:center;}
.rule select, .rule input[type=number], .rule input[type=text]{
  font-family:inherit; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text);
  border-radius:7px; padding:8px 10px; font-size:13px;
}
.mini-row{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:8px;}
.mini-row label{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;}
.mini-row input{width:140px;}

.grid2{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;}
@media(max-width:720px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

/* result banner */
.result-banner{
  border-radius:9px; padding:16px; margin-top:6px; display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:flex-start;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
}
.result-banner.ok{background:var(--success-bg); border-color:var(--success);}
.result-banner.bad{background:var(--danger-bg); border-color:var(--danger);}
.result-banner.warn{background:var(--warn-bg); border-color:var(--warn);}
.result-banner .ic{font-size:22px; line-height:1;}
.result-banner b{display:block; margin-bottom:4px; font-size:14.5px;}
.result-banner p{margin:0; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim); line-height:1.5;}
.result-banner ul{margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:18px; font-size:12.8px; color:var(--text-dim);}

/* buttons */
.btn{
  font-family:inherit; border:none; background:var(--primary); color:#fff; padding:11px 18px;
  border-radius:8px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; cursor:pointer; transition:.15s; display:inline-flex; gap:8px; align-items:center;
}
.btn:hover{background:var(--primary-2);}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent; color:var(--primary-2); border:1px solid var(--border);}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--surface-2);}
.btn.gold{background:var(--accent); color:#1a1200;}
.btn.gold:hover{background:var(--accent-2);}

/* tables */
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:9px;}
table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; min-width:640px;}
th,td{padding:9px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); text-align:left; white-space:nowrap;}
thead th{background:var(--surface-2); font-weight:600; position:sticky; top:0;}
tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--surface-2);}
td input{width:110px; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12.5px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); color:var(--text); border-radius:6px; padding:6px 8px;}
th.metric-col, td.metric-col{position:sticky; left:0; background:var(--surface); min-width:220px; white-space:normal; font-weight:500; z-index:2;}
thead th.metric-col{background:var(--surface-2); z-index:3;}
.out-cell{font-family:var(--mono); font-weight:600; color:var(--primary-2);}
.remove-peer{background:var(--danger); color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:6px; padding:5px 8px; cursor:pointer; font-size:11px;}

.ratio-group{margin-bottom:22px;}
.ratio-group h3{font-size:14.5px; margin:0 0 8px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;}
.ratio-group h3 .dot{width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%;}
.badge{font-size:10.5px; font-family:var(--mono); background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:2px 7px; border-radius:20px; color:var(--text-dim);}

.footer{
  text-align:center; padding:26px 16px 10px; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.8;
}
.footer .name{color:var(--text); font-weight:600; font-family:'Roboto Slab';}
.footer a{color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; font-weight:500;}
.footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}

.disclaimer{
  font-size:11.8px; color:var(--text-dim); background:var(--surface-2); border:1px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius:8px; padding:10px 12px; margin-top:16px; line-height:1.6;
}
.readiness-wrap{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:6px;}
.gauge{width:74px; height:74px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex:0 0 auto; font-family:var(--mono); font-weight:700; font-size:16px; color:#fff; background:conic-gradient(var(--success) 0deg, var(--success) 0deg, var(--border) 0deg);}
.field-note{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-top:4px;}
label.block{display:block; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:5px; font-weight:500;}
select.wide, input.wide{width:100%;}
.two-col-inputs{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;}
@media(max-width:640px){.two-col-inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-seal">SIC</div>
    <div class="brand-text">
      <h1>Smit IPO Ready Checker</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">Created by Smit Parekh · <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@TheParekhShow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">youtube.com/@TheParekhShow</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="top-actions">
    <button class="icon-btn" id="installBtn" onclick="triggerInstall()">⬇ Install App</button>
    <button class="icon-btn" onclick="toggleTheme()"><span id="themeIcon">🌙</span><span id="themeLabel">Night</span></button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="shell">

  <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="t1"><span class="num">1</span> Eligibility (SEBI + Exchange)</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="t2"><span class="num">2</span> Restated Financials & Proforma</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="t3"><span class="num">3</span> Basis of Issue Price</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- PANEL 1 : ELIGIBILITY -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="panel active" id="t1">

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Entities not eligible for an SME IPO <span class="tag">Regulation 228, ICDR 2018</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Tick every statement that is <b>TRUE</b> for the issuer. Any tick here is a disqualifying event — the issuer cannot make an SME initial public offer while it applies.</p>
      <div id="reg228"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Eligibility requirements for an initial public offer <span class="tag">Regulation 229</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Regulation 229 gates eligibility on post-issue paid-up capital and requires the issuer to satisfy the track record / other conditions of the SME exchange chosen. Enter the numbers below.</p>
      <div class="two-col-inputs">
        <div>
          <label class="block">Post-issue paid-up equity capital (₹ Crore)</label>
          <input type="number" class="wide" id="postIssueCapital" placeholder="e.g. 8.5" oninput="evalReg229()">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block">Was the issuer earlier a proprietorship / partnership / LLP?</label>
          <select class="wide" id="entityConversion" onchange="evalReg229()">
            <option value="no">No — always a company</option>
            <option value="yes">Yes — converted to a company</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="reg229Result" class="result-banner" style="margin-top:14px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>General conditions for the offer <span class="tag">Regulation 230</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Regulation 230 requires the issuer to have taken the following steps before / at the time of filing. Tick what is already <b>complete</b>.</p>
      <div id="reg230"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Exchange-specific eligibility <span class="tag">BSE SME &amp; NSE Emerge</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">SEBI does not prescribe turnover/profit thresholds for SME IPOs — these are layered on by the exchanges. Choose the platform and fill in the figures; unmet items are flagged in red.</p>
      <div class="mini-row" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
        <label><input type="radio" name="exch" value="bse" checked onchange="renderExchange()"> BSE SME</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="exch" value="nse" onchange="renderExchange()"> NSE Emerge</label>
      </div>
      <div id="exchangeInputs"></div>
      <div id="exchangeResult"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="readiness-wrap">
        <div class="gauge" id="gauge">–</div>
        <div>
          <b style="font-size:15px;">Overall IPO-readiness snapshot</b>
          <p class="lead" style="margin:4px 0 0;">Auto-computed from Regulation 228/229/230 and the selected exchange checklist above. This is a directional screen, not a legal opinion.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="disclaimer">This checker reflects SEBI (ICDR) Regulations, 2018 (Chapter IX — Regulations 228–268) and publicly available BSE SME / NSE Emerge listing criteria as generally in force. Exchange circulars are amended frequently (e.g. NSE Emerge FCFE computation revised April 2026); always cross-check the live SEBI/BSE/NSE circulars and consult your Merchant Banker before relying on this output.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- PANEL 2 : RESTATED FINANCIALS & PROFORMA -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="panel" id="t2">

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Restated Financial Information — framework</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        The last three years' audited financial statements must be converted into <b>Restated Financial Information</b> under Indian GAAP / the Companies Act, 2013 and the SEBI (ICDR) Regulations, 2018, prepared in accordance with:
      </p>
      <ul style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.9; color:var(--text-dim); margin:0 0 4px;">
        <li>Section 26 of Part I of Chapter III, Companies Act, 2013;</li>
        <li>Paragraph (A) of Clause 11(I), Part A, Schedule VI of the SEBI (ICDR) Regulations, 2018; and</li>
        <li>ICAI Guidance Note on "Reports in Company Prospectuses (Revised 2019)", as amended.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="section-divider">Conversion checklist — audited → restated</div>
      <div id="restatedChecklist"></div>

      <div class="section-divider">Working sheet — audited to restated bridge (per year)</div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table id="bridgeTable">
          <thead><tr>
            <th class="metric-col">Adjustment</th><th>FY1 (oldest)</th><th>FY2</th><th>FY3 (latest)</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="field-note">Enter net ₹ Lakh impact of each adjustment (use negative for a reduction). The restated PAT bridges automatically below.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-top:10px;">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th class="metric-col">Summary</th><th>FY1</th><th>FY2</th><th>FY3</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="metric-col">Audited PAT (₹ Lakh)</td>
              <td><input type="number" id="auditedPAT_0" oninput="computeBridge()"></td>
              <td><input type="number" id="auditedPAT_1" oninput="computeBridge()"></td>
              <td><input type="number" id="auditedPAT_2" oninput="computeBridge()"></td></tr>
            <tr><td class="metric-col">Net restatement adjustments</td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="bridgeAdj_0">0.00</td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="bridgeAdj_1">0.00</td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="bridgeAdj_2">0.00</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="metric-col"><b>Restated PAT (₹ Lakh)</b></td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="restatedPAT_0">0.00</td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="restatedPAT_1">0.00</td>
              <td class="out-cell" id="restatedPAT_2">0.00</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Proforma Financial Information — applicability test</h2>
      <p class="lead">Proforma financial statements are triggered when a corporate event has significantly changed the issuer's size/structure and that event is not, or is only partly, reflected in the restated financials for the full disclosure periods. Answer the questions below.</p>
      <div id="proformaQs"></div>
      <div id="proformaResult" class="result-banner" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>

      <div id="proformaTemplate" style="display:none;">
        <div class="section-divider">Proforma preparation template (if applicable)</div>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th class="metric-col">Particulars (₹ Lakh)</th><th>Restated (pre-event)</th><th>Acquired/Divested entity adjustment</th><th>Proforma combined</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="metric-col">Revenue from operations</td><td><input type="number" id="pf_rev_a" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td><input type="number" id="pf_rev_b" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td class="out-cell" id="pf_rev_c">0.00</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="metric-col">Total assets</td><td><input type="number" id="pf_ta_a" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td><input type="number" id="pf_ta_b" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td class="out-cell" id="pf_ta_c">0.00</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="metric-col">Net worth</td><td><input type="number" id="pf_nw_a" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td><input type="number" id="pf_nw_b" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td class="out-cell" id="pf_nw_c">0.00</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="metric-col">Profit after tax</td><td><input type="number" id="pf_pat_a" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td><input type="number" id="pf_pat_b" oninput="computeProforma()"></td><td class="out-cell" id="pf_pat_c">0.00</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="field-note">Proforma statements should be presented alongside restated financials with a compilation report from the statutory / peer-review auditor, adjusted only for factually supportable, directly attributable effects of the transaction (no forward-looking synergies).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="disclaimer">This module is a structuring aid. The final determination of proforma applicability, materiality thresholds and the compilation itself must be made by the issuer's statutory auditor / peer-reviewed practitioner in line with the ICAI Guidance Note and the specific SEBI ICDR clause in force on the date of filing.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <!-- PANEL 3 : BASIS OF ISSUE PRICE -->
  <!-- ============================================================ -->
  <div class="panel" id="t3">

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Issuer financial inputs</h2>
      <p class="lead">Enter figures in ₹ Lakh (shares in absolute numbers) for the last 3 audited/restated years and the stub period, if any. All ratios below recompute live.</p>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table id="mainInputTable"></table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>(a) &amp; (b) EPS and P/E ratio</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table id="epsPeTable"></table></div>
      <label class="block" style="margin-top:14px;">Proposed issue / cap price (₹ per share)</label>
      <input type="number" id="issuePrice" style="max-width:220px;" oninput="renderEpsPe();renderNav();renderPeer()">
      <p class="field-note">Weighted average EPS uses the standard 3:2:1 weight convention (latest year weighted highest). Stub period EPS is shown as reported, not annualised or blended into the weighted average, per common RHP practice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>(c) Industry peer group P/E &amp; comparable listed peers</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table id="peerTable"></table></div>
      <button class="btn ghost" onclick="addPeerRow()" style="margin-top:10px;">+ Add peer company</button>
      <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Highest peer P/E</th><th>Lowest peer P/E</th><th>Average peer P/E (industry composite)</th><th>Issuer P/E (latest year)</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody><tr>
            <td class="out-cell" id="peerHigh">–</td>
            <td class="out-cell" id="peerLow">–</td>
            <td class="out-cell" id="peerAvg">–</td>
            <td class="out-cell" id="peerIssuer">–</td>
          </tr></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>(d) Return on Net Worth (RoNW)</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table id="ronwTable"></table></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>(e) Net Asset Value (NAV) per equity share</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table id="navTable"></table></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
